! ==========================================================================
! Master.dss - Master Execution Script for Approach B Microgrid
! Common DC Bus modeled via Virtual Micro-Reactor Line System in OpenDSS-G
! ==========================================================================

Clear
New Circuit.microgrid_bms_dc

! 1. Network Foundation and Shapes
Redirect LoadShape.dss
Redirect GrowthShape.dss
Redirect TCC_Curve.dss
Redirect Spectrum.dss

! 2. Grid Source & Power Components
Redirect Vsource.dss
Redirect Transformer.dss
Redirect Line.dss
Redirect Loads.dss
Redirect PVSystem.dss
Redirect Storage.dss
Redirect SwtControl.dss

! 3. Monitoring & Metering
Redirect Monitor.dss
Redirect EnergyMeter.dss

! 4. Bus Processing & Coordinates
MakeBusList
Redirect BusVoltageBases.dss
Buscoords BusCoords.dss
GIScoords GISCoords.dss

! 5. Snapshot Power Flow Solution
Set Mode=Snapshot
Solve
